# React module UI

- Call APIs through `@namma-medmate/api-client` (`queryEnvelope` + generated `createApiClient`). No per-module HTTP wrapper.
- i18n keys `{slug}.*` via `@namma-medmate/i18n`. No hardcoded user strings.
- Cross-module UI: `src/events/events.contract.ts` + `@namma-medmate/event-bus`.
- Storybook + `src/scenarios/` like auth-ui. Export `./e2e` when apps must traverse this module.
- Stitch screens before new UI (skill `stitch-ui-design`).
- Controls from `@namma-medmate/shared-ui` (skill `shadcn-shared-ui`). Never add `components/ui` under a module.

```ts
// BAD
const res = await fetch('/auth/session');

// GOOD
const client = createApiClient({ baseUrl });
const session = await queryEnvelope(client.GET('/auth/session'));
```
